The RP2040's second-stage boot under port/chip/rp2040/boot2 is derived from
pico-sdk (https://github.com/raspberrypi/pico-sdk): BSD-3-Clause, Copyright
(c) 2019-2021 Raspberry Pi (Trading) Ltd. It carries its licence text beside
it. An image built for the RP2040 contains it.

The register addresses, offsets and field positions in lib/pico are numbers
taken from the RP2040 and RP2350 datasheets and compared with pico-sdk's
register headers (https://github.com/raspberrypi/pico-sdk, BSD-3-Clause,
Copyright (c) Raspberry Pi (Trading) Ltd.) by tools/regs_check.sh, which reads
the headers from a pico-sdk checkout named by PICO_SDK.

